# Tactics-Sandbox
#   TacticsCore/  plain C++20 library (CMake, GoogleTest)
#   TacticsUE/    Unreal Engine 5 front end

# ---------- CMake / build output ----------
# build/ is anchored: Windows git is case-insensitive, so a bare
# "build/" would also swallow Unreal's TacticsUE/Build/ folder.
/build/
/TacticsCore/build/
out/
cmake-build-*/
CMakeUserPresets.json
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
_deps/
/compile_commands.json

# ---------- vcpkg ----------
vcpkg_installed/

# ---------- Compiled files ----------
# The core's .lib is built from source, never committed.
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.idb
*.ipch
*.pch
*.gch

# ---------- IDEs ----------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.sln.DotSettings.user

# ---------- Unreal Engine (TacticsUE/) ----------
# Project files are regenerated by "Generate Visual Studio project files".
*.sln
TacticsUE/Binaries/
TacticsUE/Intermediate/
TacticsUE/Saved/
TacticsUE/DerivedDataCache/
TacticsUE/Plugins/**/Binaries/
TacticsUE/Plugins/**/Intermediate/
TacticsUE/Packaged/

# Build/ is generated, except custom app icons.
TacticsUE/Build/*
!TacticsUE/Build/*/
TacticsUE/Build/*/**
!TacticsUE/Build/**/*.ico

# Baked lighting data, regenerated by building lighting.
*_BuiltData.uasset

# ---------- Profiling, logs, crash dumps ----------
*.tracy
*.log
*.dmp

# ---------- OS ----------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
